081.csv::159.translated_text:
Teachings carved by someone emerge—

&amp;amp;amp;amp;quot;Three—endure the enemy&amp;amp;amp;amp;#x27;s 
attempts to shake you off.&amp;amp;amp;amp;quot;

081.csv::160.translated_text:
&amp;amp;amp;amp;quot;While clinging to an enemy in an enraged
state, when the yellow shake-off warning
appears, press &amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;ICON STG_TOUCH&amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;.&amp;amp;amp;amp;quot;

081.csv::206.translated_text:
&amp;amp;quot;Quickly evade without taking damage.
When close, you can swiftly
transition to offense.&amp;amp;quot;

081.csv::214.translated_text:
&amp;amp;quot;By blocking enemy attacks from all
directions while holding up your shield, you
can accumulate Force Gauge.&amp;amp;quot;

081.csv::222.translated_text:
&amp;amp;quot;By drawing enemies toward yourself, you can
block their attacks with your shield and
create opportunities for allies to attack.&amp;amp;quot;

081.csv::265.translated_text:
&amp;amp;quot;A magickal trap that deals damage when 
 enemies enter its range.
 Can be set when cast time completes.&amp;amp;quot;

081.csv::277.translated_text:
&amp;amp;quot;Depending on spell type or battle
conditions, you can also disable lock-on
entirely and cast spells freely.&amp;amp;quot;

081.csv::285.translated_text:
Teachings carved by someone emerge―

&amp;amp;quot;Lock onto your ally with 
Magick Eye: True Aid.&amp;amp;quot;

081.csv::281.translated_text:
&amp;amp;quot;Also enhances magickal power of custom
skills, so use it according to
battle conditions.&amp;amp;quot;

081.csv::291.translated_text:
&amp;amp;quot;A technique that shoots multiple targets
with magick arrows. The more enemies struck,
the greater its power becomes.&amp;amp;quot;

081.csv::299.translated_text:
&amp;quot;Hold &amp;lt;ICON STG_SUB_WEP&amp;gt; on the enemy and wait for the
focus gauge to rise. Time your magick arrow
when the gauge completes its second cycle.&amp;quot;

081.csv::300.translated_text:
&quot;The Seeker Arrow boosts attack power, while
the True Aid Arrow enhances
healing for allies.&quot;
